If there's a 1/4th chance per swing that the monster figures out
where you are, then I don't get why it is difficult to quantify.
Displacement is equivalent to infinite AC for 3 swings out of 4
and continues that trend once you know to dance every time
a swing finds you.

The cool part of displacement is it removes 3 swings out of 4
from grid bugs but it also removes 3 swings out of 4 from
balrogs.  The value of it is something like "twice as effective
as half physical damage" rather than a number.


